From 54f249b0307ea416d2c4efbde3fcdab9324f4f74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 02:08:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace homepage with curated card request page
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a JSON-driven tile grid for select high-end eBay singles with
live search, a "Request This Card" modal, and a general request panel
for unlisted cards — both posting to Formspree. Sealed/box/pack pages
and their Shopify checkout are untouched.
